/screenshots/

# Local cache of the Scryfall bulk files. `default_cards` alone is 78.8 MB and
# is re-downloadable in one command, so it is kept out of the repository and
# kept on disk - a re-ingest for fresh prices should not mean a fresh download.
/.data/

# The operator's documents stay on the operator's machine (decided 2026-09-27,
# after the wiemeinsch.ch go-live did the same): the runbook, the restore path,
# the production manifest and the working notes. None holds a secret, but a
# public list of what is not hardened yet is a checklist for an attacker, and
# nobody outside gains anything from them. They were also removed from the
# history.
/jelastic.jps
/infra/
/DEPLOYMENT.md
/RESTORE.md
/docs/phases/GO-LIVE.md
/docs/phases/RESUME.md
/docs/phases/phase-8-launch.md
/docs/phases/pre-launch-review.md
/docs/phases/vat-managed-payments.md
